            "name": "avg_npc_157_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "You can't tell? They're your men."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Of course, they've become so much more now. Much more obedient."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "And soon, you'll be just like them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_158_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "Why can you control them? You know no Originium Arts!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_157_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Only Originium Arts can control them? You people are so blinkered."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Have you ever thought about why 'Originium Arts' can control those 'infected creatures'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Of course, you, with your tiny brain, can never figure it out."
