    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_158_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "You're such a hopeless lunatic..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "I'm a member of the House of Tulla! I'm the successor to the Elder bloodline of the Tulla family."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "It's a death sentence to murder a noble on land that belongs to the Lord Ameer of Bayalir."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_157_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Lord Ameer? Noble? Bloodline?"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Haha..."
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Ahahahahaha..."
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "You amuse me, Mr. Drudge."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "But I'm tired of this joke."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "'I do not hate the pig, I hate only the golden crown that hangs above.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "In my homeland, the cardinals were burned, kings were hanged, emperors beheaded, every vestige of the old order smashed to pieces to ensure none would ever again fear the so-called 'nobility.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "What Lord Ameer? What bloodline?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "You are nothing to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "The stinking sack of meat that is your body is even less useful than those of the Oripathy sufferers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "What do you call them again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Oh yes, the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "The Infected have contributed to my experiments. But what have you done?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Your status has no value to me. And your lack of foresight is baffling."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Useless trash."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Such a vile, stupid, evil thing still calls itself 'noble'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Tell me, what part of you is noble?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Anyway, you have nothing to worry about. I have no interest in your rotten worldview... I am a scientist. I pursue only objective truth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_158_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "What do you want?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_157_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Science treats all people equally. It won't change a bit because of your background."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Nobles and commoners are the same, on the operating table. The scalpel cuts skin just as well. Your contribution is identical."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Considering you specifically, once you donate your body to science, you will no doubt be slightly more noble than you are now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "You should feel honored."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_158_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "You despicable traitor!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_157_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Traitor? Traitor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_157_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "Ahahahahaha..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "You raised your hand against your very own sister. You betrayed your flesh and blood. You colluded with foreign mercenaries to plunder your father's wealth. You betrayed the country that birthed and raised you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Levi",
        "text": "And you still have the gall to call me traitor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_158_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "You won't get away. You have no idea what the forces behind me are doing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "They're the ones who came up with all your research funding for the last six months. If you betray me now, you're betraying them too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
        "text": "The people of Volvort Kochinski will hunt you to the ends of the world. They will kill you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Drudge",
