        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frost",
        "text": "What's with the getup?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
            "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "I found it in the Lord's storehouse. It looks good."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
            "name2": "char_459_tachak_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Frost",
        "text": "...Yeah, it sure does."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Picale",
        "text": "This is the craziest battle plan I've ever heard."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_503_rang"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "Very convincing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Picale",
        "text": "How do you know an Originium explosion will draw the monsters out of the ground?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "All I can say is it's thanks to the doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "The monsters have been obeying the casters all this time, except that one night. I realized those wild monsters were actually chasing the scattered Originium shards."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Picale",
        "text": "So you decided this is the way to go?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "It's kind of a gamble, actually."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Picale",
        "text": "Where did you get this Originium engine?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "...Well... some things happened, and, I guess, we ended up with a car."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm",
        "text": "...it looks awfully familiar."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Franka",
        "text": "...isn't it the one we lost?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_503_rang"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "Let's not worry about that now. Hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Picale",
        "text": "What about the mine?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "That mercenary we caught basically gave out everything. The factory your brother used to produce monsters is located deep inside the mine. I even think he probably hasn't given up yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Picale",
        "text": "Ah... That makes sense."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "If we bait the monsters out here, Cohen will have a chance to bring her people down there and blow the *profanity* thing up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "Just as simple as that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm",
        "text": "Doesn't sound simple though..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_503_rang"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "This plan seems to be full of the unexpected and far from seamless."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "But I like this kind of plan, where battling is the only solution."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm",
        "text": "If even Rangers says so..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "All right, friends. Take your places."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "If all goes according to plan, firing up the Originium engine will get a whole bunch of monsters coming at us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "And we're in for a tough fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "And thank you, Rhodes Islanders... for choosing to stay and help."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Franka",
        "text": "Don't worry about it. It's my job to clear out contaminated wildlife."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm",
        "text": "Is that unpaid work?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Franka",
        "text": "You're so annoying!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_159_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Picale",
        "text": "...Thank you... I don't know how to express my gratitude..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_503_rang"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rangers",
        "text": "Let's save the thanks for later."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_459_tachak_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka",
        "text": "Alright. If there are no further questions..."
    },
